{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "等价无穷小", "泰勒展开"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$-\\dfrac{1}{4}$", "explanation": "对分子作泰勒展开：\n$$\n\\sqrt{1+x}=1+\\frac{x}{2}-\\frac{x^2}{8}+o(x^2),\\qquad\n\\sqrt{1-x}=1-\\frac{x}{2}-\\frac{x^2}{8}+o(x^2).\n$$\n故\n$$\n\\sqrt{1+x}+\\sqrt{1-x}-2=-\\frac{x^2}{4}+o(x^2),\n$$\n从而原极限为\n$$\n-\\frac14.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分", "面积"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{37}{12}$", "explanation": "因\n$$\ny=-x(x-2)(x+1),\n$$\n与 $x$ 轴交于 $x=-1,0,2$。在 $[-1,0]$ 上函数为负，在 $[0,2]$ 上函数为正，因此\n$$\nA=-\\int_{-1}^{0}(-x^3+x^2+2x)\\,dx+\\int_{0}^{2}(-x^3+x^2+2x)\\,dx.\n$$\n计算得\n$$\nA=\\frac14+\\frac{17}{6}=\\frac{37}{12}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$-\\cot x\\ln(\\sin x)-\\cot x-x+C$", "explanation": "令\n$$\nu=\\ln(\\sin x),\\qquad dv=\\csc^2x\\,dx,\n$$\n则\n$$\ndu=\\cot x\\,dx,\\qquad v=-\\cot x.\n$$\n所以\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\ln(\\sin x)}{\\sin^2 x}\\,dx\n=-\\cot x\\ln(\\sin x)+\\int \\cot^2x\\,dx.\n$$\n又\n$$\n\\cot^2x=\\csc^2x-1,\n$$\n故原式为\n$$\n-\\cot x\\ln(\\sin x)-\\cot x-x+C.\n$$", "methods": ["分部积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["积分上限函数", "求导"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$x f(x^2)$", "explanation": "令\n$$\nu=x^2-t^2,\\qquad du=-2t\\,dt.\n$$\n则\n$$\n\\int_0^x t\\,f(x^2-t^2)\\,dt=\\frac12\\int_0^{x^2}f(u)\\,du.\n$$\n对 $x$ 求导，得\n$$\n\\frac{d}{dx}\\int_0^x t\\,f(x^2-t^2)\\,dt\n=\\frac12f(x^2)\\cdot 2x=xf(x^2).\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["渐近线"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$y=x+\\dfrac{1}{e}$", "explanation": "当 $x\\to+\\infty$ 时，\n$$\n\\ln\\left(e+\\frac1x\\right)=1+\\ln\\left(1+\\frac{1}{ex}\\right),\n$$\n故\n$$\ny-x=x\\ln\\left(1+\\frac{1}{ex}\\right)\\to \\frac1e.\n$$\n因此斜渐近线为\n$$\ny=x+\\frac1e.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["数列极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$D$", "explanation": "若\n$$\n\\frac1{x_n}\\to 0,\n$$\n则 $x_n$ 的绝对值趋于无穷大。由\n$$\nx_ny_n\\to 0\n$$\n可写为\n$$\ny_n=\\frac{x_ny_n}{x_n},\n$$\n分子趋于 $0$，分母绝对值趋于无穷大，从而 $y_n\\to 0$。故选 $D$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["绝对值函数", "可导性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$C$", "explanation": "$|x^3-x|$ 的可能不可导点在\n$$\nx=-1,0,1.\n$$\n其中\n$$\nx^2-x-2=(x-2)(x+1),\n$$\n在 $x=-1$ 处恰为 $0$，可消去尖点；而在 $x=0,1$ 处前因子非零，所以仍不可导。故共有 $2$ 个不可导点，选 $C$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分", "可微"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$A$", "explanation": "由可微定义知\n$$\ny'(x)=\\frac{y}{1+x^2}.\n$$\n分离变量积分得\n$$\n\\frac{y'}{y}=\\frac{1}{1+x^2}\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\ln y=\\arctan x+C.\n$$\n由 $y(0)=\\pi$ 得 $C=\\ln\\pi$，故\n$$\ny=\\pi e^{\\arctan x}.\n$$\n于是\n$$\ny(1)=\\pi e^{\\pi/4}.\n$$\n选 $A$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极值", "连续性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$C$", "explanation": "由 $f(a)$ 为极大值，在 $a$ 的邻域内有\n$$\nf(x)\\le f(a).\n$$\n于是对固定的邻域内 $x\\ne a$，\n$$\n\\lim_{t\\to a}\\frac{f(t)-f(x)}{(t-x)^2}\n=\\frac{f(a)-f(x)}{(a-x)^2}\\ge 0.\n$$\n故选 $C$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["伴随矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$B$", "explanation": "伴随矩阵的每个元素都是 $n-1$ 阶子式。矩阵整体乘以 $k$ 后，每个 $n-1$ 阶子式都会被乘上\n$$\nk^{n-1}.\n$$\n因此\n$$\n(kA)^*=k^{n-1}A^*.\n$$\n故选 $B$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["间断点", "极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png", "images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "间断点为\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{4},\\ \\frac{3\\pi}{4},\\ \\frac{5\\pi}{4},\\ \\frac{7\\pi}{4}.\n$$\n其中 $\\dfrac{\\pi}{4},\\dfrac{5\\pi}{4}$ 为第二类间断点，$\\dfrac{3\\pi}{4},\\dfrac{7\\pi}{4}$ 为可去间断点。", "explanation": "间断点来自\n$$\n\\tan\\left(x-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\n$$\n无定义或为零的位置，故候选点为\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{4},\\ \\frac{3\\pi}{4},\\ \\frac{5\\pi}{4},\\ \\frac{7\\pi}{4}.\n$$\n分别考察左右极限，可得在\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{4},\\ \\frac{5\\pi}{4}\n$$\n处分母趋于 $0$ 且函数发散，为第二类间断点；在\n$$\n\\frac{3\\pi}{4},\\ \\frac{7\\pi}{4}\n$$\n处极限存在但原式无定义，为可去间断点。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["含参极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$a=1,\\ b=0,\\ c=\\dfrac12$", "explanation": "要使极限存在且非零，分母在 $x\\to0$ 时必须趋于 $0$，故只能有\n$$\nb=0.\n$$\n于是原式为\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{ax-\\sin x}{\\int_0^x \\frac{\\ln(1+t^3)}{t}\\,dt}.\n$$\n分子展开为\n$$\nax-\\sin x=(a-1)x+\\frac{x^3}{6}+o(x^3),\n$$\n分母中\n$$\n\\frac{\\ln(1+t^3)}{t}=t^2+o(t^2),\n$$\n故积分后为\n$$\n\\int_0^x \\frac{\\ln(1+t^3)}{t}\\,dt=\\frac{x^3}{3}+o(x^3).\n$$\n为使极限有限非零，需 $a=1$，从而\n$$\nc=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{x^3/6}{x^3/3}=\\frac12.\n$$", "methods": ["洛必达法则"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二阶线性微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$y=\\dfrac{C_1\\cos 2x+C_2\\sin 2x+\\frac15 e^x}{\\cos x}$", "explanation": "代入\n$$\ny=\\frac{u}{\\cos x}\n$$\n并整理，可化为\n$$\nu''+4u=e^x.\n$$\n其对应齐次方程\n$$\nu''+4u=0\n$$\n通解为\n$$\nu_h=C_1\\cos2x+C_2\\sin2x.\n$$\n设特解为 $u_p=Ae^x$，代入得\n$$\n5A=1,\\qquad A=\\frac15.\n$$\n故\n$$\nu=C_1\\cos2x+C_2\\sin2x+\\frac15e^x,\n$$\n从而\n$$\ny=\\frac{C_1\\cos 2x+C_2\\sin 2x+\\frac15 e^x}{\\cos x}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "solution", "score": 6, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["广义积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}+\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)$", "explanation": "在区间 $\\left[\\frac12,1\\right]$ 上有\n$$\n|x-x^2|=x-x^2,\n$$\n在区间 $\\left[1,\\frac32\\right]$ 上有\n$$\n|x-x^2|=x^2-x.\n$$\n于是原积分拆为两段：\n$$\n\\int_{1/2}^{1}\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{x-x^2}}\n+\n\\int_{1}^{3/2}\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{x^2-x}}.\n$$\n前一段用 $x=\\dfrac{1+\\sin t}{2}$，后一段用 $2x-1=\\sec t$，计算得\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\ln(2+\\sqrt3).\n$$", "methods": ["换元积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "solution", "score": 6, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分方程", "微分方程应用", "分离变量"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "微分方程为\n$$\nmv\\frac{dv}{dy}=mg-B\\rho-kv,\n$$\n且\n$$\ny=-\\frac{m}{k}v-\\frac{m(mg-B\\rho)}{k^2}\\ln\\!\\left(\\frac{mg-B\\rho-kv}{mg-B\\rho}\\right).\n$$\n", "explanation": "取竖直向下为正方向。由牛顿第二定律，\n$$\nm\\frac{dv}{dt}=mg-B\\rho-kv.\n$$\n又\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dt}=v,\\qquad \\frac{dv}{dt}=v\\frac{dv}{dy},\n$$\n故得到所求微分方程\n$$\nmv\\frac{dv}{dy}=mg-B\\rho-kv.\n$$\n分离变量后有\n$$\ndy=\\frac{mv}{mg-B\\rho-kv}\\,dv.\n$$\n利用初始条件 $y=0,\\ v=0$ 积分，得\n$$\ny=-\\frac{m}{k}v-\\frac{m(mg-B\\rho)}{k^2}\\ln\\!\\left(\\frac{mg-B\\rho-kv}{mg-B\\rho}\\right).\n$$", "methods": ["隐函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "proof", "score": 8, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["零点定理", "Rolle定理"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "存在唯一的 $x_0\\in(0,1)$ 使\n$$\nx_0f(x_0)=\\int_{x_0}^{1}f(x)\\,dx.\n$$\n", "explanation": "令\n$$\n\\varphi(x)=xf(x)-\\int_x^1 f(t)\\,dt.\n$$\n则\n$$\n\\varphi(0)=-\\int_0^1f(t)\\,dt\\le 0,\\qquad \\varphi(1)=f(1)\\ge 0.\n$$\n由连续性知存在\n$$\nx_0\\in(0,1)\n$$\n使 $\\varphi(x_0)=0$，即\n$$\nx_0f(x_0)=\\int_{x_0}^{1}f(x)\\,dx.\n$$\n这正是题意。\n\n再求导：\n$$\n\\varphi'(x)=f(x)+xf'(x)+f(x)=2f(x)+xf'(x).\n$$\n由已知\n$$\nf'(x)>-\\frac{2f(x)}{x}\n$$\n得\n$$\n\\varphi'(x)>0.\n$$\n故 $\\varphi(x)$ 在 $(0,1)$ 内严格单调递增，因此零点唯一。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 8, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["旋转曲面", "切线"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{(11\\sqrt5-1)\\pi}{6}$", "explanation": "设切点为 $(x_0,y_0)$，则\n$$\ny_0=\\sqrt{x_0-1},\\qquad y'=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x-1}}.\n$$\n切线过原点，代入切线方程可得\n$$\nx_0=2,\\qquad y_0=1,\n$$\n故切线为\n$$\ny=\\frac{x}{2}.\n$$\n\n曲线段 $x\\in[1,2]$ 绕 $x$ 轴旋转的面积为\n$$\nS_1=2\\pi\\int_1^2 y\\sqrt{1+(y')^2}\\,dx\n=\\frac{(5\\sqrt5-1)\\pi}{6}.\n$$\n线段 $y=\\dfrac{x}{2},\\ x\\in[0,2]$ 旋转所得面积为\n$$\nS_2=2\\pi\\int_0^2 \\frac{x}{2}\\sqrt{1+\\left(\\frac12\\right)^2}\\,dx\n=\\pi\\sqrt5.\n$$\n故总表面积为\n$$\nS=S_1+S_2=\\frac{(11\\sqrt5-1)\\pi}{6}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 8, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["曲率", "微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "曲线方程为\n$$\ny=-\\ln\\cos\\left(x-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)+1+\\ln2,\\qquad -\\frac{\\pi}{4}<x<\\frac{3\\pi}{4}.\n$$\n其极大值为\n$$\n1+\\ln2\n$$\n（在 $x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$ 处取得），无极小值。", "explanation": "由曲率公式与“向上凸”条件得\n$$\n\\frac{y''}{(1+y'^2)^{3/2}}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+y'^2}},\n$$\n即\n$$\ny''=1+y'^2.\n$$\n令 $p=y'$，则\n$$\np'=1+p^2.\n$$\n积分得\n$$\n\\arctan p=x+C_1.\n$$\n由点 $(0,1)$ 处切线为 $y=x+1$，知\n$$\ny'(0)=1,\n$$\n故\n$$\np=\\tan\\left(x+\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right).\n$$\n再积分并由 $y(0)=1$ 定常数，得\n$$\ny=-\\ln\\cos\\left(x-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)+1+\\ln2.\n$$\n当\n$$\nx=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\n$$\n时取极大值\n$$\n1+\\ln2,\n$$\n且在定义区间内无极小值。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "proof", "score": 8, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不等式", "单调性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png", "images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "见解析。", "explanation": "(1) 令\n$$\n\\phi(x)=x^2-(1+x)\\ln^2(1+x).\n$$\n逐次求导可证\n$$\n\\phi'(x)>0\\qquad(0<x<1),\n$$\n又 $\\phi(0)=0$，故\n$$\n\\phi(x)>0,\n$$\n即\n$$\n(1+x)\\ln^2(1+x)<x^2.\n$$\n\n(2) 令\n$$\ng(x)=\\frac{1}{\\ln(1+x)}-\\frac{1}{x}.\n$$\n计算导数可知 $g(x)$ 在 $(0,1)$ 上单调递减，因此\n$$\ng(1)<g(x)<\\lim_{x\\to0^+}g(x).\n$$\n由\n$$\ng(1)=\\frac1{\\ln2}-1,\\qquad \\lim_{x\\to0^+}g(x)=\\frac12,\n$$\n得\n$$\n\\frac1{\\ln2}-1<\\frac{1}{\\ln(1+x)}-\\frac1x<\\frac12.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["矩阵方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$\nA=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&0&0&0\\\\\n-2&1&0&0\\\\\n1&-2&1&0\\\\\n0&1&-2&1\n\\end{pmatrix}\n$", "explanation": "由原式左乘 $C$，得\n$$\n(2C-B)A^T=E.\n$$\n所以\n$$\nA^T=(2C-B)^{-1}.\n$$\n先算\n$$\n2C-B=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&2&3&4\\\\\n0&1&2&3\\\\\n0&0&1&2\\\\\n0&0&0&1\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n其逆矩阵为\n$$\n(2C-B)^{-1}=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&-2&1&0\\\\\n0&1&-2&1\\\\\n0&0&1&-2\\\\\n0&0&0&1\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n故\n$$\nA=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&0&0&0\\\\\n-2&1&0&0\\\\\n1&-2&1&0\\\\\n0&1&-2&1\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998_q021", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1998", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1998, "question_number": 21, "question_type": "solution", "score": 6, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["线性表示", "非齐次线性方程组"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1998_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1998_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q021.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "当 $b\\ne2$ 时不能表示；\n\n当 $b=2,a\\ne1$ 时，\n$$\n\\beta=\\alpha_1-2\\alpha_2;\n$$\n\n当 $b=2,a=1$ 时，有无穷多种表示，\n$$\n\\beta=(2k+1)\\alpha_1+(-k-2)\\alpha_2+k\\alpha_3\\qquad(k\\in\\mathbb R).\n$$\n", "explanation": "设\n$$\nx_1\\alpha_1+x_2\\alpha_2+x_3\\alpha_3=\\beta,\n$$\n化为非齐次线性方程组。对其增广矩阵作初等变换，可得：\n\n- 当 $b\\ne2$ 时，增广矩阵出现矛盾行，因此无解，$\\beta$ 不能由 $\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\alpha_3$ 线性表示；\n- 当 $b=2,\\ a\\ne1$ 时，方程组有唯一解\n$$\nx_1=1,\\quad x_2=-2,\\quad x_3=0,\n$$\n故\n$$\n\\beta=\\alpha_1-2\\alpha_2;\n$$\n- 当 $b=2,\\ a=1$ 时，方程组有无穷多解。令自由参数为 $k$，可得\n$$\nx_1=2k+1,\\qquad x_2=-k-2,\\qquad x_3=k.\n$$\n所以\n$$\n\\beta=(2k+1)\\alpha_1+(-k-2)\\alpha_2+k\\alpha_3.\n$$", "methods": []}
